# apt mirrorlist: Ubuntu archive (main/updates/backports).
#
# Edit this file in place for your site; rebuild points apt here
# directly (path derived from the repo location).
#
# One URI per line; apt tries them in order with automatic failover.
# Optional per-line filters, space-separated after the URI, e.g.:
#   https://mirror.example.com/ubuntu/   priority:1
#   http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/    arch=amd64,i386
#
# The default below auto-selects a nearby mirror and falls back to the
# canonical archive.  Replace with your own local mirror for best speed.
mirror+https://mirrors.ubuntu.com/mirrors.txt
http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/
